   "props": {
    "text": "CONTAINMENT BULKHEAD — LOG\n17 OCT 1998\n\n02:47  Containment order issued (Hale).\n02:48:40  Solace, M. through, from the lift. Twenty seconds.\n02:49  Bulkhead closed. Manual. Hale.\n        Persons inside per headcount: 23.\n\n(Hale's hand, pressed hard enough to tear the paper:)\nShe looked at me through the glass. I did it anyway.\nGod forgive me.\n\nTo anyone who ever opens this from out here, for any voice — any voice — you are killing everyone above you.",
