    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "Observation deck. Run nineteen minus six hours. I'm putting the rule on tape, because I've finally understood it."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_b6aed2ff45"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "It can't exist without a listener. It's made of being heard. Two people in a room, talking, checking each other — it's thin. It's weather. It's nothing."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_d6c7bf2aa8"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "But one person alone, listening hard — that's a door it can walk through. That's why it knows when someone is alone. Loneliness is the only shape it can wear."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_79427a2070"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "Marcus's rule was right. Nobody listens alone."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_0d9688a5ac"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "And I've been listening to it alone for four years."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_4d2e885bce"
    }
   ]
  },
